  "ingredients": [
    "6 tablespoon butter (unsalted, melted)",
    "2 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "3 large egg",
    "1 1/2 cup almond flour",
    "1/2 tablespoon instant coffee",
    "1/2 cup unsweetened dark cocoa powder",
    "1/2 teaspoon salt",
    "1 cup erythritol",
    "1 teaspoon baking powder",
    "16 ounce cream cheese (softened)",
    "1 large egg (room temperature)",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1/2 cup erythritol"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 350F and lightly grease a baking pan. In a large mixing bowl, whisk together the melted unsalted butter and vanilla extract. Add eggs and whisk until combined.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/mocha-cheesecake-bars/#wprm-recipe-52067-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/Mocha-Cheesecake-Bars-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a small bowl, mix together the almond flour, instant coffee, cocoa powder, salt, erythritol, and baking powder. Then, combine the wet ingredients with the dry ingredients. Set aside a small portion of the batter for the thin brownie crust.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/mocha-cheesecake-bars/#wprm-recipe-52067-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/Mocha-Cheesecake-Bar-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the larger portion of batter to the baking pan. The batter will be a bit thicker than traditional brownie batter.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/mocha-cheesecake-bars/#wprm-recipe-52067-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/Mocha-Cheesecake-Bars-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a mixing bowl, blend the room-temperature cream cheese, egg, vanilla extract, and erythritol until smooth. Spread this mixture on top of the brownie layer.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/mocha-cheesecake-bars/#wprm-recipe-52067-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/Mocha-Cheesecake-Bars-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using the smaller portion of brownie set aside earlier, mix it into the top layer of cream cheese to create a brownie crust. This layer should be very thin.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/mocha-cheesecake-bars/#wprm-recipe-52067-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/Mocha-Cheesecake-Bars-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake for 30–35 minutes. When finished, allow the bars to cool completely before slicing.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/mocha-cheesecake-bars/#wprm-recipe-52067-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/Mocha-Cheesecake-Bars-Final-620x900.jpg"
    }
  ],
